{"notice":"The keeper can pause (stop rules) but never unpause, activate, withdraw or change limits."},"moveOrder(uint256,(int24,int24,uint128,uint128),uint256)":{"notice":"Move one order: close `tokenId` into the vault and mint `o` in the same tx (gas: one tx instead of two)."},"ownerClose(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Owner can always close positions, even when paused/inactive."},"place((int24,int24,uint128,uint128),uint256)":{"notice":"Mint one single-sided [tickLower, tickUpper) position (above spot: MON only; at/below spot: token1 only)."},"setApprovals(bool)":{"notice":"Owner can revoke (false) or re-grant (true) the standing token1 -> Permit2 -> PositionManager allowance."},"snapshot()":{"notice":"One-call keeper snapshot."},"token1ToMonEq(uint256,uint160)":{"notice":"token1 raw units -> MON wei at sqrtP (price = token1 per MON = (sqrtP/2^96)^2)."},"withdrawAll(uint256)":{"notice":"Pause + deactivate, close every open position, and send ALL MON and token1 to the owner."}},"notice":"V5 safety model, generalised to multi-tick ranges and any native-MON/ERC20 pool fixed at deploy:   - ONE immutable pool key (currency0 = native MON, currency1 = `token1`, fee, tickSpacing, no hooks).   - Keeper may ONLY place single-sided ranges near spot (width, distance, size and count capped by the owner), close them back     INTO this vault, move them (close + place in one tx) and pause. It can never withdraw, unpause, activate or change limits/keeper.   - Only the immutable owner funds (deposit / token transfer), activates, unpauses, changes limits/keeper/approvals, and withdraws;     every withdrawal goes to the owner. withdrawAll = pause + deactivate + close everything + send all to the owner.   - One long-lived token1 -> Permit2 -> PositionManager approval (owner can revoke / re-grant). Deploys INACTIVE.   - MON is only accepted from the owner (deposit / plain send) and from the v4 PositionManager / PoolManager (refunds, closes).","version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"MonafMakerVaultV6.sol":"MonafMakerVaultV6"},"evmVersion":"cancun","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":2000},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"MonafMakerVaultV6.sol":{"keccak256":"0xdf0438021ff444881b57593e226745e9b447e463140a62a34d18b15493a261fa","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://0d0c67bb8e1b5f9b2bc941861fca89abc298ddaf0459abd52f2f21d57d0ccd57","dweb:/ipfs/QmdX9Aicp7kSNRSw4jeN1wNPMQQg3F4wdXjT5awqjt89g5"]}},"version":1}